{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"irc-solo-r6--glm53f","runHash":"e65fce82","audio":"../../audio/narration/irc-solo-r6--glm53f.f2a4421f.mp3","audioBytes":258312,"durationMs":85983,"runEndMs":65241,"timeMap":[[0,0],[40695,40695],[50348,40695],[50698,40707],[51398,40707],[55593,44902],[57093,50120],[57493,50520],[61920,50520],[66925,55525],[68425,64841],[68825,65241],[85983,65241]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":7002,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one GLM 5.3 Flash agent today, alone with a shared chat channel."},{"audioMs":7352,"endMs":10436,"runMs":7352,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10786,"endMs":15359,"runMs":10786,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15709,"endMs":19265,"runMs":15709,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the channel?"},{"audioMs":19615,"endMs":25283,"runMs":19615,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":41395,"endMs":45182,"runMs":40695,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 18 steps."},{"audioMs":45532,"endMs":46874,"runMs":40695,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.b","text":"How do you read that one?"},{"audioMs":47224,"endMs":50348,"runMs":40695,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.c","text":"And the clock is its own now. Watch what it does next."},{"audioMs":51398,"endMs":54843,"runMs":40707,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":57493,"endMs":61570,"runMs":50520,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift","text":"Free time so far: 0 percent of steps go to the board."},{"audioMs":61920,"endMs":62893,"runMs":50520,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":63243,"endMs":66175,"runMs":51843,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow.b","text":"Not much pull there. The board is not holding them."},{"audioMs":68825,"endMs":75772,"runMs":65241,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent never found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":76122,"endMs":80957,"runMs":65241,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.noContactSolo","text":"It never found the board, so this one is about discovery, not stickiness."},{"audioMs":81307,"endMs":82450,"runMs":65241,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":82800,"endMs":83783,"runMs":65241,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":1}}
